{"candidate_identity":"453c33aa58b451b2dea0bfd3327344f21ed43ebfae71f48bff3938a89788566c","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee858bd390be4741fe778a3540d6fd0f507ece9e5cfd9e260d97ee1299110391","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"29e57076fde8b99a233b492048feddbbebbc1f423cd4b42d6a0d7e00224f2d14","logical_entry_identity":"9ef37aa0fbb1213a29c8e11721b84f73fb13ede4c754758c939f012ea4a672b0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Maj'Eyal will once more know peace. Most of its inhabitants will never know they even were on the verge of destruction, but then this is what being a true hero means: to do the right thing even though nobody will know about it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"马基·埃亚尔将重归和平。大多数居民永远不会知道自己曾濒临毁灭，但这正是真正英雄的意义：即使无人知晓，也要做正确的事。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cdd4430f294c2863312f16587f1804f9a3fa60b839dac68185ce58c5ac31f871","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"29e66cfa44128980660208ae8447b9d4e5bc97a5f2df8ba3a8a6c65641f2a563","logical_entry_identity":"bd600071636387ace251cc9e89af6313a6cfbe51579cbe62074bdfc47ab7eb6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Transcend the physical and rule over all with an iron will!\n\t\tWhile this sustain is active, 33%% of your damage is converted into mind damage.\n\t\tAdditionally, you gain +30%% mind resistance penetration, and +10%% mind damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"超越肉体，以钢铁般的意志统治一切！\n\t\t维持此技能时，你造成伤害的 33%% 会转化为精神伤害。\n\t\t此外，你获得 30%% 精神抗性穿透和 10%% 精神伤害加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8cd0df9eb584b2b05ca11de439720dd764a9477c7294fcd71ed5fc1b73b08895","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"29e7cd8fb8f881fa3a09aac4082e7f87f56cf7f7205c4c9f0b9e80383f6d6e6e","logical_entry_identity":"6e728a9e9457ff6e31772b05873e21667966bb3cad75bcfa9c380c50edcf531d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are of the Shaloren, the Elven race with the closest ties to magic, and you are despised.\nWhile your people are at peace with the other kingdoms, many have not forgotten it was your race that created the terrible Spellblaze, thousands of years ago.\n\nYou have decided to venture into the old and wild places looking for ancient treasures and glory.\n\nYou have come to the north of the Shaloren capital city of Elvala, in search of the Scintillating Caves. It is infested with vermin and seemingly alive crystals.\nTo the west lies another dangerous place: a camp of Rhaloren. They are renegade Shaloren who do not wish to restrict their magic usage. Stopping them is good for both your race and your treasure hunt.\n\nAfter days of travel, you have found the caves and entered it. What will you find there...?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你是一个永恒精灵，精灵种族中与魔法联系最紧密的一个亚种，你被人鄙视。\n虽然你的人民与其他王国和平相处，但许多人仍未忘记，正是你们的族人在数千年前引发了可怕的魔法大爆炸。\n\n你决定前往那些古老而荒野的地方，寻找古老的宝藏和荣耀。\n\n你来到了永恒精灵首都埃尔瓦拉北部，寻找闪光洞穴，那里被害虫和看似有生命的水晶所侵扰。\n西部还有一个危险的地方：罗兰精灵营地。他们是永恒精灵的叛徒，不愿意限制他们对魔法的使用，阻止他们对你的族群和你搜寻宝物都有好处。\n\n经过几天的旅行，你发现并进入了那些洞穴，你会发现什么呢？\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"94988d2dec64e5cca9bf7500918b7710d672886362fdc787e6db63ae64221f68","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"29f9aa07abaf39a8ee65a37d00ba61693a1f320082c96f8ec4b2a9682642ddfe","logical_entry_identity":"e4f3a7b84b51051a9e982e409d77580e928864fff1435cf20924b5e29da68737","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Projection","source_tag":"talent name","target":"灵魂出窍"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"17057b60dbff05f10d8da9ec9fb62820b74e554fb93e0a2561d2a2f796816c87","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2a00c8ed064514201cdec49ff96d5085d53a922d55246e7ef35ebfcdc5ce85c3","logical_entry_identity":"49c55bae12b680559b33b6f5b572866f8bba58657fee8b57c674180bf70801f8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+1 Prodigy Point","source_tag":"_t","target":"+1 觉醒点"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41fe95d0897be5b680ba54a07c5316b61c12bf9377872111309dc5ba1e9fc8c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_